  command /handoff source="user" hint="" "Independently verify and present finished work when an ordinary diff and focused checks are not enough to judge it, including third-party branches or pull requests. Use compact proof for easily judged behavior and a decision page for consequential or difficult work. Do not invoke at project start or impose a page on ordinary small changes."
